00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.010
A-Are you okay?

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.850
Please don't do anything rash.

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:26.320
Chika-chan, are you all right?

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.540
I hope it's all right?

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:27.200
Yeah.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:35.340
Now I've got yet another precious memory.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:47.260
I need to make even more
happy memories with everyone.

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.020
It's Fall already!

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:40.630
Where is
Kaoru-sama's happiness?

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:43.880
My happiness is right here.

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:49.220
When I can't see him and when
I'm with him, my happiness is...

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:51.930
right, within Kaoru-sama.

00:22:53.090 --> 00:22:56.140
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:57.230
White.

00:22:58.370 --> 00:22:59.730
I think of Kaoru-sama.

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:04.900
With that alone, I am happy.
